"The values in the tables reflect the supplied ``application.yml`` and Java "
"property defaults that it does not override. In particular, the YAML "
"configuration sets the model to ``text-embedding-3-large``, the minimum "
"chunk size to ``50`` characters, and the ECOS content limit to ``5120 KB``; "
"the Java class defaults differ."

